Confirmation commands used after OTA:
  lamp status  -> off, color (160,0,255), brightness 37%, mode breathe, timer off
  lamp scene load 3 -> scene 3 loaded: (160,0,255) 37% breathe
  relay status -> closed, auto on, cycles 108
  health       -> auto on, interval 45 s (now 45 s in NORMAL)
